Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Port Agent Maintenance UI from hamphh/dockge 1.2

- Wire the existing (previously unwired) agent-maintenance.ts backend
  logic and DockerArtefact* types to a new socket handler
- Add AgentMaintenance.vue page, DockerArtefact.vue and
  ProgressTerminal.vue components (per-agent view of containers,
  images, networks, volumes: prune, remove, pull)
- Add /agent and /agent/:endpoint routes, a Maintenance link on
  each agent's card in DashboardHome, missing i18n strings, the
  missing faChevronRight icon, and the missing $dark-header-active-bg
  scss var
- Verified: tsc --noEmit clean, vite frontend build clean, eslint
  clean on all touched/added files (pre-existing lint debt in
  dockge-server.ts/DashboardHome.vue left untouched)
